# Build context of the store image is the repository root; this file (next to
# the Dockerfile, picked up by BuildKit) restricts it to an allowlist.
# Other apps, local node_modules/.next (host binaries and cache), .env files and
# tooling such as .claude/ never reach the image. Add new paths here deliberately.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/store/
!infra/docker/store/

apps/store/node_modules/
apps/store/.next/
apps/store/next-env.d.ts
apps/store/coverage/
apps/store/.env*
infra/docker/store/Dockerfile*
**/.DS_Store
**/.gitignore
